	(text_box "The 10 pin connector used on the motor looks like the 3.81mm plug connector. Here's a list of\nwhat I think are likely compatable connectors.\n\nDB2EB-3.81-10P-GN\nterms like KF2EDG, EDG are pretty common terms associated with them along with \nMCV\n\nCurrent assumption is that for multi motor compatability MIL-MAX connectors will be soldered in place"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
